extends layout

block content
  .container.py-4
    h1.h2.mb-4 About Shelf-To-Stove
    .row.g-4
      .col-md-7
        p Shelf-To-Stove is a recipe manager built around one question: what can I cook with the food I already have? Store your recipes, keep a live inventory of your pantry, and find recipes by how well they match what is on hand.
        p It is made for college students cooking on a budget, roommates sharing a kitchen, and anyone trying to use food before it expires. It is a CS 408 Full Stack Web Development project.

        h2.h4.mt-4 Tech Stack
        ul
          li Node.js 24 + Express 5
          li SQLite (better-sqlite3)
          li Pug templates + Bootstrap 5.3
          li Hosted on AWS EC2 (Ubuntu 24.04) behind Nginx

        h2.h4.mt-4 Credits
        ul
          li
            a(href='https://getbootstrap.com') Bootstrap
            |  (MIT License)
          li
            a(href='https://icons.getbootstrap.com') Bootstrap Icons
            |  (MIT License)
          li Seed recipes written by Oliver Hill
      .col-md-5
        .card.shadow-sm
          .card-icon.bg-sage-subtle
            i.bi.bi-basket2-fill(aria-hidden='true')
          .card-body
            h2.h5.card-title Source code
            p.card-text.text-body-secondary The full project is on GitHub.
            a.btn.btn-outline-secondary(href='https://github.com/Oliver-Hill00/CS408-ShelfToStove') GitHub Repo
